h journal PDFs verify as genuine Domrina. Filling the remaining report sections, then sealing.The hunt is **CLOSED**. Genuine Izvestiya II bytes are in `refs/`, page-verified against the Ni3Al reject rule. The sealed report is `xmodel/domrina-fulltext-hunt-grok46-20260901.md`.
