+## 6. Full-Cone Implication
+
+If `J_t^tail` has dimension zero, then every larger homogeneous ideal
+containing it also has dimension zero.  Therefore
+
+```text
+J_t^tail subset I_{t,+} and dim S_t/J_t^tail = 0
+  => dim S_t/I_{t,+} = 0.
+```
