+```text
+tail hsop
+  => dim I_{t,+}=0 by containment
+  => (V0)
+  => terminal unit statement (8.1) through the banked CONE criterion
+  => theorem (T) through the banked CONE chain.
+```
+
+## 8. FALLACY-v2
